Lesson 9.10 · Financial Management
Financial health and sustainability

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Judge financial health by resilience and dependency, not by the size of your first grant.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Track reserves, runway and your largest income source.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Check whether projects recover their full costs.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Set targets and watch how the measures change.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You choose your health measures, starting values and targets.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

